---
description: Generator frontend page + component (Supabase via Server Components/Actions)
globs:
  - src/app/**/*.tsx
  - src/components/**/*.tsx
  - src/lib/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: true
---

Use this rule when creating a new page, component, or client-side module.

FILE TYPES (mandatory)
- New work: **only** `src/**/*.ts` and `src/**/*.tsx`. **Never** generate `src/**/*.js`.
- Default to Server Components; add `"use client"` only when required.

DATA ACCESS
- Server Components: fetch via `createClient()` from `@/lib/supabase/server` or import from `src/lib/**`.
- Client Components: call Server Actions — do NOT call Supabase directly unless existing pattern requires it.
- Normalize types in `src/lib/**`:
  - BigInt string → number at boundary
  - NUMERIC string → `Number(...)` (guard NaN)
  - JSON string → safe parse with fallback

PAGE MODULE (`src/app/<route>/page.tsx`)
- Prefer async Server Component for initial data load.
- Pass data to Client Components as props when interactivity needed.
- Colocate Server Actions in `actions.ts` next to the route.

CLIENT COMPONENT (`src/components/**` or `"use client"` pages)
- No direct Supabase calls unless repo already uses that pattern in the same area.
- Async rule (mandatory): every async flow uses `try/catch/finally` and clears loading in `finally`.
- Provide empty state + error state; never render blank screen on failure.

FORMS / MUTATIONS
- Prefer Server Actions for mutations triggered from forms.
- Disable submit while pending (`useFormStatus` or local `isSubmitting` state).
- Show user-visible error on failure; revalidate or refresh data on success.

LIST PAGES (when applicable)
- Server-side pagination via `.range()` / `.limit()` in Supabase query.
- Debounce client search (e.g. 300ms) when filtering client-side.

VERIFICATION (mandatory after scaffold — Rule 43)
- Run: `npm run lint` + `npm run build`
- Record Target Output + Verification Report in `docs/ai/CHANGE_CHECKLIST.md`
- See `docs/ai/TARGET_OUTPUT_VERIFICATION.md`
